{"id":"6ff1528fd8b1a074","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-lem-upward-abs.md","title":"Upward Absoluteness","display":"lem-upward-abs — Upward Absoluteness","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-upward-abs","aliases":["58-lem-upward-abs"],"display":"lem-upward-abs — Upward Absoluteness","depends_on":["[[58-df-absolute]]","[[58-df-elementary]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-transitive-set]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-sigma-one-formula]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-upward-abs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-upward-abs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-upward-abs — Upward Absoluteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36b4649dd248921c\" href=\"?note=36b4649dd248921c\" title=\"58-df-absolute\">58-df-absolute</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"58-df-elementary\">58-df-elementary</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"58-df-transitive-set\">58-df-transitive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5f363231f41efc07\" href=\"?note=5f363231f41efc07\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-sigma-one-formula\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-sigma-one-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment\">../batch03/58-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in V\">\\(M,N\\in V\\)</span> (transitive set universes) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N\">\\(\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N\\)</span> (their membership structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_M),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_M),\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_N)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\)</span> (universe and binary-relation interpretation selectors)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\in},\\varphi,s,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\in},\\varphi,s,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaOneFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma_{\\in})\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaOneFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\)</span> (formula-complexity predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> (transitive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"58-df-transitive-set\">58-df-transitive-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> (explicit satisfaction and assignment predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}upward\\text{-}abs} \\vdash\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{SigmaOneFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\land M\\subseteq N\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_M)=M\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_N)=N\\land I^{\\mathcal M_M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\in\\cap M^2\\land I^{\\mathcal M_N}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\in\\cap N^2\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_N,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_N,s)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,s)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}upward\\text{-}abs} \\vdash\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{SigmaOneFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma_{\\in})\\land M\\subseteq N\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_M)=M\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_N)=N\\land I^{\\mathcal M_M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\in\\cap M^2\\land I^{\\mathcal M_N}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\in\\cap N^2\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_M,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_N,\\Sigma_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_N,s)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,s)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> formulas with assignments from the smaller transitive set are upward absolute between the canonical membership structures. The repaired statement no longer treats <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_S\">\\(\\models_S\\)</span> as a binary primitive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-absolute","status":"resolved","id":"36b4649dd248921c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-absolute]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-sigma-one-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5f363231f41efc07","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-sigma-one-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"c1